    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math practical and interesting, especially in physics and biology. As a part-time student, I use it for problem-solving and real-world applications. I don’t see it as abstract or intimidating—more like a tool. I enjoy the logic and structure, even if it takes time to grasp. My relationship with math is grounded in curiosity and daily use.",
